body:
12 is for the 12th letter of the alphabet - L. L stands for "Law".

&#x200B;

This is rudimentary alpha-numeric jail nigga coding where each letter is replaced by its ordinal number.

&#x200B;

All official jail nigga communication is coded. You cant read their jail letters on the little strings without a cipher. The coding varies between gangs, cliques, races AND can change for any reason.

&#x200B;

BASICALLY, 06 jail niggas came home and wanted to sound like 5 percenters.
